{
  "name": "Speech Beyond the Grave",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to reach beyond death's veil in search of knowledge. Using this feature, you can cast Speak with Dead without material components, and you understand what the target of this casting says. It can understand your questions, even if you don't share a language or it is not intelligent enough to speak.</p><p>Once you use this feature, you can't use it again until you finish a Short or a Long Rest.</p>",
